#: ../../../docs/reference/documentation-tools.md:40
msgid ""
"The native closure includes its libc loader, C/C++ runtime libraries, "
"Graphviz core/dot/Pango plugins, fontconfig and each library actually linked"
" by those executables and renderers. Preparation executes the locked "
"loader's `--list` operation and rejects paths outside the prefix. It removes"
" unsupported renderers instead of discovering host GTK, GD or Ghostscript "
"installations. This tool set supports the maintained DOT/SVG/Cairo diagram "
"path, not every Graphviz renderer."
msgstr ""
"Native 闭包包含 libc 加载器、C/C++ 运行库、Graphviz core／dot／Pango "
"插件、fontconfig，以及这些执行文件和渲染器实际链接的每个库。准备流程执行锁定加载器的 `--list`，拒绝 prefix "
"外路径。它移除不支持的渲染器，不发现主机 GTK、GD 或 Ghostscript 安装。此工具集支持维护中的 DOT／SVG／Cairo "
"图链，不支持每一种 Graphviz 渲染器。"

#: ../../../docs/reference/documentation-tools.md:47
msgid ""
"Linux kernel, the CPython/venv bootstrap, `dpkg-deb` and a POSIX shell are "
"explicit host prerequisites. Their observed values belong to the preparation"
" receipt. This lock does not claim a reproducible host image or a bitwise "
"identical kernel."
msgstr ""
"Linux 内核、CPython／venv 引导、`dpkg-deb` 和 POSIX shell "
"是明确主机前提，其实测值记录在准备回执中。本锁不宣称主机镜像可复现或内核逐字节相同。"

#: ../../../docs/reference/documentation-tools.md:51
msgid "Prepare a fresh prefix"
msgstr "准备新 prefix"

#: ../../../docs/reference/documentation-tools.md:53
msgid "Run from the repository root, with CPython 3.12 available:"
msgstr "从仓库根目录、在 CPython 3.12 可用的条件下执行："

#: ../../../docs/reference/documentation-tools.md:60
msgid ""
"Preparation may download archives over HTTPS. It verifies the entire archive"
" closure before creating the prefix. Wheel installation then uses `--no-"
"index`, `--find-links` and `--require-hashes`; no transitive package is left"
" for a fresh online resolution. Native packages are extracted locally "
"without `sudo` or system package installation."
msgstr ""
"准备流程可以通过 HTTPS 下载归档。它先验证整个归档闭包，再创建 prefix。wheel 包安装随后使用 `--no-"
"index`、`--find-links` 和 `--require-hashes`；没有传递依赖留给新的在线解析。Native 包在本地解包，不使用 "
"`sudo` 或系统包安装。"

#: ../../../docs/reference/documentation-tools.md:66
msgid "For an independent installation from a previously prepared cache:"
msgstr "从此前准备的缓存进行独立安装："

#: ../../../docs/reference/documentation-tools.md:73
msgid ""
"The expected result is exit code zero and `installation.json` in the fresh "
"prefix. It records the lock digest, observed tool versions, kernel, resolved"
" ELF closure, archive digests, installed file digests and copied license "
"digests. The installed `bin/fc-match` must resolve `Noto Sans CJK SC` from "
"the locked font package. A missing archive, changed byte, failed command or "
"mismatched font fails preparation and leaves no success prefix."
msgstr ""
"预期结果是退出码零，以及新 prefix 中的 `installation.json`。它记录工具锁摘要、实测版本、内核、解析后的 ELF "
"闭包、归档摘要、已安装文件摘要与复制许可摘要。安装后的 `bin/fc-match` 必须从锁定字体包解析 `Noto Sans CJK "
"SC`。归档缺失、字节变化、命令失败或字体不匹配都会使准备失败，不留下成功 prefix。"

#: ../../../docs/reference/documentation-tools.md:80
msgid ""
"An existing prefix is rejected. Choose a fresh path for an upgrade; do not "
"silently mutate an installation already referenced by build evidence. "
"Archive cache corruption also fails rather than being silently replaced by a"
" download."
msgstr "已有 prefix 会被拒绝。升级时选择新路径，不得静默改变已经被构建证据引用的安装。缓存归档损坏同样失败，不通过重新下载静默替换。"

#: ../../../docs/reference/documentation-tools.md:84
msgid "Use the single documentation CLI"
msgstr "使用唯一文档 CLI"

#: ../../../docs/reference/documentation-tools.md:86
msgid ""
"Run the maintained CLI with the prepared Python and explicit tool prefix:"
msgstr "使用准备好的 Python 和显式工具 prefix 运行维护 CLI："

#: ../../../docs/reference/documentation-tools.md:97
msgid ""
"`install.environment(prefix)` returns a verified subprocess environment with"
" the locked tool executables first on `PATH`. `install.diagnose(prefix)` "
"rejects a changed lock, changed installed file or changed license before "
"reporting tool identity. Neither operation installs or downloads tools. "
"Builds must generate fresh XML and HTML; a former successful output cannot "
"rescue a failed command."
msgstr ""
"`install.environment(prefix)` 返回已验证的子进程环境，将锁定执行文件放在 `PATH` "
"首位。`install.diagnose(prefix)` 在报告工具身份前拒绝变化的工具锁、已安装文件或许可。两者均不安装或下载工具。构建必须生成新的"
" XML 与 HTML；旧成功输出不能补救失败命令。"

#: ../../../docs/reference/documentation-tools.md:103
msgid ""
"The `scripts/tools/docs.py`, `.sh`, `.ps1` and `.bat` entries only forward "
"to this CLI. Legacy `all`, `doxygen` and `sphinx` targets all select the "
"same complete strict build. Removed generation modifiers are rejected; "
"wrappers cannot create a fallback Doxyfile or Sphinx configuration. Windows "
"and macOS wrappers preserve CLI forwarding, while a formal build still "
"requires the maintained Linux tuple."
msgstr ""
"`scripts/tools/docs.py`、`.sh`、`.ps1` 和 `.bat` 入口只转发到此 CLI。旧 `all`、`doxygen` "
"和 `sphinx` 目标都选择同一完整严格构建。已移除的生成修饰选项会被拒绝；包装入口不能创建回退 Doxyfile 或 Sphinx "
"配置。Windows 与 macOS 包装入口保留 CLI 转发，正式构建仍要求维护中的 Linux 工具组合。"

#: ../../../docs/reference/documentation-tools.md:109
msgid "Replay the API mobile-layout regression"
msgstr "重放 API 移动端布局回归"

#: ../../../docs/reference/documentation-tools.md:111
msgid ""
"This optional diagnostic needs an existing Chromium and Playwright in "
"addition to the documented Sphinx tuple. It never installs tools. Use a "
"separate prepared browser test environment; the formal documentation build "
"and default stdlib test suite do not import Playwright."
msgstr ""
"此可选诊断除了已说明的 Sphinx 工具组合，还需要已有的 Chromium 和 "
"Playwright。它不会安装工具。请使用单独准备的浏览器测试环境；正式文档构建和默认 stdlib 测试套件不导入 Playwright。"

#: ../../../docs/reference/documentation-tools.md:116
msgid ""
"Run from the repository root, supplying the existing browser executable:"
msgstr "在仓库根目录执行，并提供已有的浏览器可执行文件："

#: ../../../docs/reference/documentation-tools.md:123
msgid ""
"The helper builds a temporary English/Chinese C API fixture from the "
"production theme. At 390 CSS pixels it checks long signatures, unchanged "
"symbols and anchors, complete code and table content with internal "
"scrolling, and an unclipped page. Missing tools or failed checks return "
"nonzero. A successful receipt qualifies only that fixture and observed "
"browser; full-site responsive acceptance and deployment remain separate."
msgstr ""
"该工具使用当前主题构建临时中英文 C API fixture，在 390 CSS "
"像素下检查长签名、保持原样的符号和锚点、可内部滚动的完整代码及表格内容，以及页面无裁切。工具缺失或检查失败返回非零。成功记录只覆盖该 fixture "
"和实际浏览器；全站响应式验收与部署分别判断。"

#: ../../../docs/reference/documentation-tools.md:130
msgid "Search the current site"
msgstr "搜索当前站点"

#: ../../../docs/reference/documentation-tools.md:132
msgid ""
"The English and Chinese search pages use their own local Sphinx index and "
"current-language metadata. The Chinese tokenizer has no external dictionary "
"dependency and accepts Han character sequences and Latin identifiers. "
"Separate keywords with whitespace for combined queries, such as `借用 排空` or "
"`借用 HAL`."
msgstr ""
"中英文搜索页面分别使用本地 Sphinx "
"索引和当前语言的元数据。中文分词器不依赖外部分词词典，可处理汉字序列和拉丁字符标识符。组合查询时使用空格分隔关键词，例如 `借用 排空` 或 `借用 "
"HAL`。"

#: ../../../docs/reference/documentation-tools.md:137
msgid ""
"Results show the version, content type, source and actual language, and body"
" excerpts. Search assets load only on the search page. Archive links and "
"original qualification records retain their frozen source and language "
"scope."
msgstr "结果展示版本、内容类型、源语言和实际语言，以及正文摘要。搜索资源仅在搜索页面加载。归档链接和原始资格记录保留其冻结的源码与语言范围。"

#: ../../../docs/reference/documentation-tools.md:141
msgid "CI permission boundary"
msgstr "CI 权限边界"

#: ../../../docs/reference/documentation-tools.md:143
msgid ""
"`docs-build.yml` has only `contents: read`. It prepares the locked tools, "
"checks source, executes the documentation tool suite and builds both "
"languages. Only successful build output and actual reports enter its CI "
"artifact. Artifact upload does not establish deployment or firmware "
"acceptance. Pages publication, archive recovery and software candidate "
"promotion are outside this workflow."
msgstr ""
"`docs-build.yml` 只有 `contents: read` "
"权限。它准备锁定工具、检查源码、执行文档工具测试并构建两种语言。只有成功的构建输出和实际报告进入 CI "
"artifact。上传产物不建立部署或固件验收；Pages 发布、归档恢复和软件候选晋升不属于该工作流。"

#: ../../../docs/reference/documentation-tools.md:149
msgid "License and upgrade handling"
msgstr "许可与升级处理"

#: ../../../docs/reference/documentation-tools.md:151
msgid ""
"Each native archive carries its Debian copyright files. The locked `base-"
"files` archive supplies every referenced complete text in `licenses/common-"
"licenses/`; preparation rejects a missing shared license reference. Wheel "
"license files are copied from the verified wheel; the five upstream wheels "
"which omit license text use checked-in texts extracted from their exact "
"verified source distributions. The lock records source archive digest, "
"member and extracted text digest. The Doxygen archive carries its complete "
"license text. Preparation copies these texts into `prefix/licenses/`; retain"
" that license payload when redistributing tools."
msgstr ""
"每份原生归档包含 Debian 版权文件。锁定的 `base-files` 归档提供 `licenses/common-licenses/` "
"中所有被引用的完整文本；共享许可引用缺失时准备失败。wheel 许可文件从已核验的 wheel 复制；五份未附许可正文的上游 wheel "
"使用从其准确、已核验源码分发中提取并提交的文本。锁记录源码归档摘要、成员及提取文本摘要。Doxygen 归档包含完整许可正文。准备工具将这些文本复制到 "
"`prefix/licenses/`；再分发工具时保留这些许可内容。"

#: ../../../docs/reference/documentation-tools.md:160
msgid ""
"To upgrade, review upstream changes and licenses, resolve one new exact "
"closure, update both lock and hash requirements, execute a fresh online "
"preparation and an independent offline preparation, then run documentation "
"tool tests, strict bilingual builds and diagram freshness checks. Retain raw"
" failures and results; an updated version string alone is insufficient "
"acceptance evidence."
msgstr ""
"升级时审查上游变化和许可证，解析新的准确闭包，同时更新锁与哈希要求，执行新的在线准备和独立离线准备，再运行文档工具测试、严格双语构建和图新鲜度检查。保留原始失败与结果；只更新版本字符串不足以建立验收证据。"
